  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Insofu in the room - Addressing the lack of academic freedom in Zambia 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership project between DSF and ZANASU 2022-2024 aims to understand and expose the lack of academic freedom in Zambia. We believe this issue is of extreme importance for the well-being of students and the future of education in the country. Thus, we attempt to address the elephant in the room, or ?the insofu in the room?. This is done through a series of activities that are divided into two groups. The first is aiming at understanding academic freedom based on peer and intercultural learning, information sharing, and research. The second is aiming at exposing our understanding through a social media campaign and reaching out to key stakeholders such as the ministry of education and to our primary target group which is university students. With this Partnership Project, we wish to develop meaningful youth engagement, enhance quality education, and subsequently promote active citizenship.</narrative>
  </description>
